        <span itemprop="subject">the base tape</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was then immersed in a methylene chloride bath to extract liquid paraffin and decalin. Thereafter, the base tape was dried at 50° C. and subjected to an annealing process at 120° C. to provide a polyethylene microporous membrane.</span>
