        <span itemprop="definition">each were immersed in a coagulation liquid at a weight ratio of water/DMAc/TPG of 50/30/20 at 40° C., and then rinsed with water and dried to form a heat resistant porous layers on both the front and back surfaces of the polyethylene microporous membrane.</span>
